Visual ideas
------------
The look of the main window takes its ideas from three designs published on
21st.dev. No code from them is included: Track Livery's window is an original
native implementation in Swift/AppKit. With thanks to their authors:

- "Interactive Tech Stack Bento Grid with Hover Effects" by themeocean
  (the glowing cards and the step log)
- "Sonic Waveform" by dhileepkumargm (the flowing lines along the bottom)
- "Siri Wave" on 21st.dev (the colour wave in the drop zone)

Sparkle
